/*!
    \qmltype RegularType
    \inqmlmodule QmlSingletonTest
    \since QmlSingletonTest 1.0
    \brief A regular QML type for comparison.

    This is a regular QML type that is not a singleton.
    It should not show any singleton indicators.
*/

/*!
    \qmlproperty string RegularType::name

    The name of this type instance.
*/

/*!
    \qmlmethod void RegularType::performAction()

    Performs an action on this instance.
*/

